<title>UK: Polydoc seeks Amsterdam share listing.</title>
<headline>Polydoc seeks Amsterdam share listing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Dutch technology company Polydoc Plc said on Thursday it is seeking a listing on the Nieuwe Markt of the Amsterdam stock exchange.</p>
<p>It expects trading to start in March.</p>
<p>Polydoc launched a share issue on London's Alternative Investment Market (AIM) in September 1996 of 4.5 million new shares at 65p per share.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
